OL,3,GNEWSAFive in hospital after head-on
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive people have been taken to hospital
OL,7,Fafter a head-on collision shut the A61
OL,8,FSir Frank Whittle Road in Derby.
OL,10,FPolice said a black Mercedes E220
OL,11,Ftravelling from Little Eaton towards
OL,12,FPentagon Island crashed with a silver
OL,13,FFord Tourneo travelling in the opposite
OL,14,Fdirection at about 03:50 BST on Friday.
OL,16,FTwo drivers and three passengers were
OL,17,Ftaken to hospital with "significant
OL,18,Finjuries". Two passengers of the Ford -
OL,19,Fa man and a woman both in their 70s -
OL,20,Fsuffered "potentially life-threatening"
OL,21,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
